WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.796 --> 00:00:03.824
&gt;&gt; Dana: WILLIAM LA JEUNESSE,

00:00:03.859 --> 00:00:04.942
THANK YOU.

00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:07.609
&gt;&gt; Bill: BORDER PATROL AGENTS

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:10.110
RECENTLY CAPTURED MORE THAN 100

00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:11.359
PEOPLE IN SEVERAL SMUGGLING

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:11.873
ATTEMPTS.

00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:13.962
IN LAREDO TEXAS ON THE BORDER.

00:00:13.964 --> 00:00:19.945
THE CITY IS WAITING FOR FEMA TO

00:00:19.946 --> 00:00:22.455
ARRIVE AND HELP OUT.

00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:24.184
TEXAS MAYOR PETE SAENZ IN

00:00:24.186 --> 00:00:24.720
LAREDO.

00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:26.427
IT CAUGHT MY EYE.

00:00:26.462 --> 00:00:29.785
YOU HAD A TRACTOR TRAILER

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:32.328
PULLED OVER, 44 PEOPLE INSIDE.

00:00:32.363 --> 00:00:34.091
A COMMERCIAL TANKER, 43 PEOPLE

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:34.495
INSIDE.

00:00:34.529 --> 00:00:35.745
ANOTHER TRACTOR TRAILER MARCH

00:00:35.779 --> 00:00:37.608
9, 24 PEOPLE INSIDE.

00:00:37.642 --> 00:00:39.500
WHAT ARE YOU UP AGAINST, MAYOR?

00:00:39.535 --> 00:00:40.521
&gt;&gt; EXACTLY THAT.

00:00:40.555 --> 00:00:42.115
THANK YOU FOR HAVING ME THIS

00:00:42.117 --> 00:00:42.730
MORNING BILL.

00:00:42.763 --> 00:00:45.118
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:00:45.153 --> 00:00:47.488
JUST A BRIEF DESCRIPTION.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:49.396
LAREDO IS 160 MILES UPRIVERS

00:00:49.397 --> 00:00:52.328
FROM BROWNSVILLE AND 600 MILES

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:54.666
DOWN RIVER FROM EL PASO SO

00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:57.017
PEOPLE KNOW.

00:00:57.051 --> 00:01:00.750
LAND PORT IN THE ENTIRE WESTERN

00:01:00.784 --> 00:01:01.628
HEMISPHERE.

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:04.406
YES, WE’VE BEEN -- EACH REGION.

00:01:04.407 --> 00:01:08.246
LAREDO SECTION IS DIFFERENT

00:01:08.247 --> 00:01:11.767
FROM THE EL PASO AND DEL RIO.

00:01:11.768 --> 00:01:13.495
WE EXPERIENCE MORE SINGLE

00:01:13.496 --> 00:01:16.430
ADULTS FROM LAST YEAR COMPARED

00:01:16.464 --> 00:01:19.431
TO THIS YEAR, THERE HAS BEEN

00:01:19.465 --> 00:01:21.069
ABOUT 140% INCREASE.

00:01:21.104 --> 00:01:22.505
THAT’S SUBSTANTIAL.

00:01:22.506 --> 00:01:26.640
AND 90% OF THEM ARE SINGLE MALE

00:01:26.641 --> 00:01:29.010
ADULTS PRIMARILY FROM MEXICO.

00:01:29.044 --> 00:01:30.887
OF COURSE, THESE FOLKS THEN

00:01:30.922 --> 00:01:32.180
THROUGH THE CARTELS OR THE

00:01:32.181 --> 00:01:34.044
CRIMINAL ACTIVITY THAT WE HAVE

00:01:34.078 --> 00:01:35.913
IN THE BORDER AREA ON THE

00:01:35.914 --> 00:01:38.233
MEXICAN SIDE AND OVERFLOWS TO A

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:40.890
CERTAIN EXTENT ONTO OUR SIDE.

00:01:40.925 --> 00:01:43.504
ALTHOUGH OUR CITIES ARE SAFE

00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:45.249
BUT YET MATTERS OF THIS CALIBER

00:01:45.283 --> 00:01:46.286
DO OCCUR.

00:01:46.287 --> 00:01:50.237
THEY END UP IN STASH HOUSES.

00:01:50.272 --> 00:01:52.553
FROM THE STASH HOUSES THEY END

00:01:52.554 --> 00:01:53.616
UP BOARDING THESE TRACTOR

00:01:53.617 --> 00:01:56.941
TRAILERS OR THESE VANS.

00:01:56.943 --> 00:02:00.218
WE HAVE HAD A SIGNIFICANT

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:02.366
INCREASE CLOSE TO 4,000 ARRESTS

00:02:02.401 --> 00:02:05.050
-- 2,000 ARRESTS IN STASH

00:02:05.051 --> 00:02:07.503
HOUSES AND I WOULD SAY ABOUT

00:02:07.537 --> 00:02:09.933
CLOSE TO THAT AMOUNT ALSO ON

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:13.393
THESE VANS AND TRACTOR TRAILERS.

00:02:13.394 --> 00:02:16.952
AS A MAYOR THAT CONCERNS ME.

00:02:16.954 --> 00:02:19.278
OBVIOUSLY THERE IS THE

00:02:19.279 --> 00:02:20.658
POTENTIAL OF THINGS ESCALATING

00:02:20.659 --> 00:02:21.918
AND MORE OVERFLOW.

00:02:21.919 --> 00:02:23.463
I’M GLAD THE BORDER PATROL IS

00:02:23.464 --> 00:02:25.225
HERE AND FEDERAL AGENCIES.

00:02:25.227 --> 00:02:26.751
&gt;&gt; Bill: THEY HAVE TO DO

00:02:26.785 --> 00:02:27.151
SOMETHING.

00:02:27.185 --> 00:02:28.734
AHEAD OF HOMELAND SECURITY THEY

00:02:28.768 --> 00:02:31.298
SAID THE BORDER IS SECURE AND

00:02:31.333 --> 00:02:33.307
THE BORDER IS CLOSED.

00:02:33.309 --> 00:02:35.352
IS IT SECURE AND CLOSED, MAYOR?

00:02:35.386 --> 00:02:37.216
&gt;&gt; NO, TO BOTH THOSE QUESTIONS.

00:02:37.217 --> 00:02:39.357
I HEARD THAT YESTERDAY FROM

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:40.702
BOTH PRESIDENT BIDEN AND ALSO

00:02:40.703 --> 00:02:41.833
FROM SECRETARY MAYORKAS.

00:02:41.834 --> 00:02:43.422
THESE ARE GOOD WORDS AND I

00:02:43.457 --> 00:02:45.159
APPRECIATE THAT VERY MUCH BUT

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:46.429
WORDS NEED TO BE FOLLOWED BY

00:02:46.463 --> 00:02:47.436
ACTIONS.

00:02:47.437 --> 00:02:52.795
WE HAVEN’T SEEN ACTIONS YET.

00:02:52.796 --> 00:02:56.302
DOES IT MEAN THAT THESE UAC’S

00:02:56.303 --> 00:02:58.148
UNACCOMPANIED AND FAMILIES

00:02:58.182 --> 00:02:59.842
TURNED AWAY TO CONTINUE USING

00:02:59.877 --> 00:03:01.193
TITLE 42?

00:03:01.227 --> 00:03:03.493
IF NOT, THEN THOSE WORDS ARE

00:03:03.528 --> 00:03:04.258
MEANINGLESS.

00:03:04.259 --> 00:03:06.974
SO WHAT DO WE DO?

00:03:07.008 --> 00:03:09.408
HONESTLY, I THINK THERE IS A

00:03:09.409 --> 00:03:11.532
PLAN TO AMEND THE ASYLUM LAWS.

00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:13.349
SO PEOPLE CAN APPLY FROM THEIR

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:14.177
COUNTRIES OF ORIGIN.

00:03:14.178 --> 00:03:16.859
THAT WOULD BE GREAT.

00:03:16.893 --> 00:03:19.814
THE POINT HERE BEING IS THAT WE

00:03:19.848 --> 00:03:22.441
NEED TO PREVENT THIS JOURNEY

00:03:22.442 --> 00:03:23.890
FROM THOSE COUNTRIES TO THE

00:03:23.925 --> 00:03:24.316
BORDER.

00:03:24.351 --> 00:03:26.411
IT IS LESS RISK, LIFE AND LIMB

00:03:26.413 --> 00:03:30.066
AND MONEY AND SO ON TO THESE

00:03:30.101 --> 00:03:31.864
FOLKS BUT ALSO HERE IN THE

00:03:31.898 --> 00:03:32.214
COMMUNITY.

00:03:32.215 --> 00:03:34.177
WE’RE THE FIRST RESPONDERS.

00:03:34.179 --> 00:03:36.184
THEY NEED TO BE COGNIZANT OF

00:03:36.185 --> 00:03:36.523
THAT.

00:03:36.557 --> 00:03:38.460
WE NEED THIS THING REMEDIED

00:03:38.461 --> 00:03:39.109
QUICKLY.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.356
&gt;&gt; Bill: THANK YOU, MAYOR, PETE

